                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A heavy stick or club, usually used by policemen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "India",
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f25d2373-54fb-4337-90b0-d717ae56b37c",
                                                "sense_id": "3a2547e5-555f-3f08-bac3-9262ac2aeb56",
                                                "text": "The iron-bound bamboo staves, known as lâtees, with which most disputes among rival zemindars were traditionally settled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "315ba563-ebd6-4bb4-9e37-09cf16560a38",
                                                "sense_id": "3a2547e5-555f-3f08-bac3-9262ac2aeb56",
                                                "text": "A phalanx of policemen armed with lathis faced a mob of mill workers squatting on the road."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "283aa46d-0671-4eea-a4f5-ed51068a1307",
                                                "sense_id": "3a2547e5-555f-3f08-bac3-9262ac2aeb56",
                                                "text": "Nearby, held back by a line of lathi-carrying peons, stood the farmers whose vessels were being weighed […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f6e65095-3e03-3c30-9da8-3c9155a2cdfd",
                                        "entry_id": "b693299c-c02f-3ae1-be45-f6e831bc318c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A martial art based on stick fighting originally practiced in India."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
